  "body": "Beautifully Renovated | Single-Level Living | Exceptional Parking\r\n\r\nLooking for your first home? This beautifully renovated Stanmore Bay gem could be exactly what you've been searching for!\r\n\r\nOffering modern comfort, easy single-level living, and fantastic indoor-outdoor flow, this home combines style, practicality, and the relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWHAT YOU'LL LOVE\r\n\r\n•  3 spacious bedrooms\r\n•  2 stylish, modern bathrooms\r\n•  Master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n•  Beautifully renovated throughout\r\n•  Light-filled open-plan living\r\n•  Sunny outdoor entertaining deck\r\n•  Single garage plus carport\r\n•  Exceptional off-street parking\r\n•  Plenty of room for the boat, caravan, or trailer\r\n•  Convenient single-level living\r\n\r\nLOCATION, LIFESTYLE & CONVENIENCE\r\nEnjoy everything the Hibiscus Coast has to offer! Just minutes from Stanmore Bay Beach, local schools, cafés, shopping, and Whangaparaoa Plaza, everything you need is close to home.\r\n\r\nFRESH PRICE – $819,000!\r\nBeautifully renovated, brilliantly located, and offering parking that's hard to beat! Whether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer, or growing family, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nCome and see it for yourself! Contact Team Steenberg – Barfoot & Thompson Millwater today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nTEAM STEENBERG\r\nNo Stress. Just Success.",
